comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-29T00:19:58.543Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all-status PM items for stdin-json and notes; closed pm-kipd delivered the original round-trip feature and pm-a2h3 delivered direct note editing, but neither tracks this new silent no-op defect. GitHub issue #1343 has no prior PM link."
body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1343\n\nReproduce with a disposable tracker: create an item with a note, get the full JSON item, edit notes[0].text, and pipe it to update --stdin-json. Require either an atomic audited note correction or a nonzero field-specific rejection with pm notes --edit guidance."
